---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
const areas=[['Forecasting & planning','Building forecasting and planning processes that help leaders understand the business and make informed decisions.'],['Analytics & reporting','Improving sales reporting and connecting data with the questions leaders need to answer.'],['Sales technology & processes','Helping organizations get more value from their systems and data, with operational practices that support the team.'],['Global operations leadership','Leading operations teams and working across sales, finance, technology, and executive leadership to keep priorities aligned.']];
---
<Layout title="Experience" description="More than 20 years in sales strategy, Revenue Operations, analytics, and sales technology at Authorize.Net, Cybersource, and Visa."><section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Experience</p><h1>Experience earned<br/>inside the business.</h1><p class="text-xl">More than two decades across sales strategy, Revenue Operations, analytics, and sales technology.</p></section><section class="section bg-[#eef1ee]"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-24"><div><h2>A perspective shaped by doing.</h2><p>My career has included VP-level roles at Visa and Cybersource, with work spanning Authorize.Net, Cybersource, and Visa.</p><p>I've led global operations teams, built forecasting and planning processes, improved sales reporting, and helped organizations get more value from their systems and data.</p><p>Working closely with sales, finance, technology, and executive leadership has taught me how important it is to connect the operational details with the bigger picture.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Organizations where I've worked</p><div class="serif text-3xl border-t border-[#cbd4d8] py-5">Visa</div><div class="serif text-3xl border-t border-[#cbd4d8] py-5">Cybersource</div><div class="serif text-3xl border-y border-[#cbd4d8] py-5">Authorize.Net</div><p class="small mt-5">Professional experience, not a list of RevLytics clients.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Selected areas of work</p><h2>Connecting strategy<br/>with day-to-day operations.</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mt-12">{areas.map(([title,body])=><article class="focus"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><ContactCTA/></Layout>
